{"id":"95e854a713c07e6d","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-corecover.md","title":"Essential prime implicants occur in every prime cover","display":"thm-corecover — Essential prime implicants occur in every prime cover","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-corecover","aliases":["27-thm-corecover"],"display":"thm-corecover — Essential prime implicants occur in every prime cover","depends_on":["[[27-df-boolfunc]]","[[27-df-dnf]]","[[27-df-piset]]","[[27-df-boolop]]","[[27-df-corepi]]"],"local_review_status":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-corecover"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-corecover</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-corecover — Essential prime implicants occur in every prime cover"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"11de8465f2282555\" href=\"?note=11de8465f2282555\" title=\"27-df-boolop\">27-df-boolop</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c417c668c09a97ed\" href=\"?note=c417c668c09a97ed\" title=\"27-df-corepi\">27-df-corepi</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> (Boolean function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\">\\(D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\)</span> (DNF term set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\)</span> (prime-implicant set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CorePI}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{CorePI}(f)\\)</span> (essential prime implicants, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c417c668c09a97ed\" href=\"?note=c417c668c09a97ed\" title=\"27-df-corepi\">27-df-corepi</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigvee\">\\(\\bigvee\\)</span> 的有限布尔标量及空族语义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"11de8465f2282555\" href=\"?note=11de8465f2282555\" title=\"27-df-boolop\">27-df-boolop</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;\\forall D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\;\\bigl(D\\subseteq\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a)=\\bigvee_{T\\in D}T(a))\\to\\mathrm{CorePI}(f)\\subseteq D\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;\\forall D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\;\\bigl(D\\subseteq\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a)=\\bigvee_{T\\in D}T(a))\\to\\mathrm{CorePI}(f)\\subseteq D\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Restricting <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> to prime implicants is essential; arbitrary non-prime terms need not contain a core prime implicant literally.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-dnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-piset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolop","status":"resolved","id":"11de8465f2282555","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolop]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-corepi","status":"resolved","id":"c417c668c09a97ed","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-corepi]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ (Boolean function, see [[27-df-boolfunc]])","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n$ (DNF term set, see [[27-df-dnf]])","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PI}(f)$ (prime-implicant set, see [[27-df-piset]])","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-corepi","status":"resolved","id":"c417c668c09a97ed","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CorePI}(f)$ (essential prime implicants, see [[27-df-corepi]])","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolop","status":"resolved","id":"11de8465f2282555","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\bigvee$ 的有限布尔标量及空族语义见 [[27-df-boolop]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PI}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CorePI}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigvee","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;\\forall D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\;\\bigl(D\\subseteq\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a)=\\bigvee_{T\\in D}T(a))\\to\\mathrm{CorePI}(f)\\subseteq D\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"D","display":false}],"bytes":1244,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-395","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-corecover|thm-corecover — Essential prime implicants occur in every prime cover]]"}],"outgoing":["5d10aed668d85817","0b618255959ff4bc","3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","11de8465f2282555","c417c668c09a97ed"]}